    "story": "They say every wanted poster leaves out the best parts.\n\nYou can call me outlaw, hero, fool—it’s all the same once the ink dries. I’ve walked farther and waited longer than most men ever will, and there’s more truth in these scars than any bounty notice could print.\n\nThis is my story. You want the rest? You’ll have to hear it from me.",
